  "summary": "\n●\tAround 5 years of experience working in a corporate environment as a front-end UI/Web Developer. \n●\tExperienced in complex website development including web-based applications.\n●\tExperienced in developing highly interactive web applications utilizing JavaScript, HTML 5, CSS, JSON, Angular JS 1.x, Angular2/4/5/6/9 and Bootstrap and integrating Restful API’s. \n●\tIn depth knowledge of web technologies and standards across mobile and web devices including responsive UI. \n●\tFundamental knowledge of application development using Java technologies like Node.JS, REST and Frameworks such as JDBC, Spring, XML, XSLT, JAXB, JAXP, DB2 etc\n●\tExperience in Software life cycle phases like Requirement Analysis, Implementation and estimating the time-lines for the project.  \n●\t Proficient in building Web User Interface (UI) using HTML5, CSS3, table less XHTML and JavaScript that follows W3C Web Standards and are browser compatible.  \n●\tExpert in working with cutting edge front- end technologies/ framework and libraries like JQuery, Prototype, XHTML, JSON, DOM, CSS, XML, AJAX.  \n●\tExperience in Web 2.0 applications like blog maintenance, Library Management, social networking using HTML, DHTML, JavaScript.\n●\tSkillful in Angular Features like creating custom Directives, Dependency Injection, Modules and Routing. \n●\tHands-on experience with using software version control tools like GIT.\n●\tExperience in using UI-Router for binding data to different states and rendering different templates.\n●\tHands on experience working on different browsers like Safari, Internet Explorer, Mozilla Firefox and Google Chrome and checking cross browser compatibility.\n●\tAbility to write well-documented, well-commented, clear and maintainable efficient code for web development. Developed application using NodeJS JavaScript libraries with NPM package management system \n●\tProficient understanding of code versioning tools Git(Github), SVN\n●\tSelf-starter always inclined to learn new technologies and Team with very good communication, organizational and interpersonal skills.\n●\tExperienced in developing Single Page Applications of AngularJS.\n●\tExperienced in developing SOAP and REST based applications.\n●\tWorked in various version control systems – SVN, GIT.\n●\tUnderstanding of Model View Controller MVC, MVVM, MVP design patterns.\n●\tWorked in Agile Development process.\n●\tWorking knowledge on cross browser / cross device compatibility with prominence on Responsive web design principles.\n●\tStrong foundation in JavaScript along with AngularJs1.x, Angular2/4/5/6\n",
